@UI\nFeature: BlazeDemo Flight Booking\n  As a user of BlazeDemo\n  I want to search for flights and book a ticket\n  So that I can travel from one city to another\n\n  @Positive @SearchFlights\n  Scenario: Search for flights\n    Given I navigate to BlazeDemo homepage\n    When I select 'Boston' as the departure city and 'New York' as the destination city\n    And I click on 'Find Flights'\n    Then I should see a list of available flights\n\n  @Positive @BookFlight\n  Scenario: Book a flight\n    Given I have searched for flights from 'Boston' to 'New York'\n    When I select the first available flight\n    And I enter passenger details\n    And I click on 'Purchase Flight'\n    Then I should see a confirmation message\n\n  @Negative @InvalidSearch\n  Scenario: Search for flights with invalid cities\n    Given I navigate to BlazeDemo homepage\n    When I select 'InvalidCity' as the departure city and 'New York' as the destination city\n    And I click on 'Find Flights'\n    Then I should see an error message\n\n  @Negative @IncompleteBooking\n  Scenario: Book a flight without entering passenger details\n    Given I have searched for flights from 'Boston' to 'New York'\n    When I select the first available flight\n    And I do not enter passenger details\n    And I click on 'Purchase Flight'\n    Then I should see an error message